Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:03.22,Default,,0,0,100,,The 48 Laws of Power by Robert Greene in two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.22,0:00:06.82,Default,,0,0,100,,Most people believe that if you just work hard and play nice,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.82,0:00:10.26,Default,,0,0,100,,virtue will protect you. Here is the brutal truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.26,0:00:13.06,Default,,0,0,100,,Virtue without strategy gets you crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:14.58,Default,,0,0,100,,Power is like gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:18.49,Default,,0,0,100,,You don\'t have to like it, but if you ignore its laws, you fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:21.93,Default,,0,0,100,,Take Law Number One. Never outshine the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.93,0:00:25.36,Default,,0,0,100,,Nicolas Fouquet was the brilliant French finance minister
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:31.24,Default,,0,0,100,,who built a magnificent palace and threw the most lavish party in history to impress King Louis the fourteenth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:34.12,Default,,0,0,100,,The result? The King felt outshone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.12,0:00:38.20,Default,,0,0,100,,humiliated, and threw Fouquet into a dark dungeon for the rest of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:40.98,Default,,0,0,100,,Always make those above you appear brilliant,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:42.88,Default,,0,0,100,,and keep your own brilliance concealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:46.80,Default,,0,0,100,,Next, Law Number Three. Conceal your intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:50.48,Default,,0,0,100,,If people know what you are aiming for, they can build defenses,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:53.27,Default,,0,0,100,,lay traps, or sabotage your path.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.27,0:00:55.75,Default,,0,0,100,,Use decoy goals and smoke screens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.75,0:00:59.10,Default,,0,0,100,,Let them watch your left hand while your right hand strikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:03.02,Default,,0,0,100,,Then, Law Number Four. Always say less than necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.02,0:01:07.02,Default,,0,0,100,,Powerful people impress and intimidate by saying very little.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:09.66,Default,,0,0,100,,The more you speak, the more common you appear,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:12.12,Default,,0,0,100,,and the higher the risk of uttering something foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.12,0:01:16.34,Default,,0,0,100,,Silence makes people uncomfortable, forcing them to fill the void,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.34,0:01:17.97,Default,,0,0,100,,and reveal their own hidden secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:23.08,Default,,0,0,100,,Next, Law Number Nine. Win through actions, never through argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:27.34,Default,,0,0,100,,A verbal debate victory is hollow and breeds bitter resentment
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:28.70,Default,,0,0,100,,that lasts for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.70,0:01:30.86,Default,,0,0,100,,Never argue. Demonstrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.86,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,100,,When you show results without arguing,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:36.08,Default,,0,0,100,,you win without making enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:40.16,Default,,0,0,100,,Then, Law Number 28. Enter action with boldness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.16,0:01:43.92,Default,,0,0,100,,Timidity creates hesitation and invites disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,100,,If you are unsure of a course of action, do not attempt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:50.67,Default,,0,0,100,,Audacity strikes fear into your rivals,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.67,0:01:52.53,Default,,0,0,100,,and everyone admires the bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.53,0:01:56.53,Default,,0,0,100,,When conflict is unavoidable, remember Law Number 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.53,0:01:58.45,Default,,0,0,100,,Crush your enemy totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.45,0:02:01.47,Default,,0,0,100,,A viper only half-crushed will heal, hide,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.47,0:02:03.38,Default,,0,0,100,,and strike back with deadlier venom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.38,0:02:07.56,Default,,0,0,100,,If you must defeat a rival, leave zero room for retaliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.56,0:02:11.96,Default,,0,0,100,,And finally, Law 48. Assume formlessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.96,0:02:17.79,Default,,0,0,100,,Rigid plans shatter under pressure. Fixed strategies become predictable targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.79,0:02:23.79,Default,,0,0,100,,Be like water, flowing around obstacles, unpredictable and impossible to pin down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.79,0:02:25.90,Default,,0,0,100,,So tell me in the comments below.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.90,0:02:35.90,Default,,0,0,100,,Would you rather sit alone on a cold throne with absolute supreme power and zero real friends, or live around a warm campfire with true friendship and zero power?